            "question_4": "What if Alpha Brew doesn’t work for me?",
            "answer_4": "<p>IT has been proven to work for all types of an but we do understand that every man is different, which is why Alpha Brew comes with a <strong>100% money-back guarantee. </strong>If you don’t notice improved energy, drive, or performance, just contact us for a full refund — no questions asked</p>",
            "question_5": "How Does It Taste?",
